  _infoPointHeadingText: Play Specialist
  _subtitleText: Hi, I'm the play specialist on Clark Clinic. I wear a yellow uniform.
    Sometimes when you have to come into hospital, you can feel a wee bit anxious.
    But my job on the ward is to come and introduce myself to you and find out what
    you're interested in so that I can find in my many cupboards something to occupy
    you while you're in hospital to make your day go a wee bit more quickly and more
    enjoyable for you.
