  _infoPointHeadingText: Family Support Worker
  _subtitleText: Hi, I'm a family support worker for Children's Heartbeat Trust,
    a local children's charity offering practical and emotional support to families
    in Northern Ireland who have a child with congenital heart disease. We have a
    great relationship here with the Team on Clark Clinic and you can find a member
    of our support team here three times a week with a friendly face, a listening
    ear and lots of ways to help support local heart families through our specialist
    support services at each stage of your journey with congenital heart disease.
