      value: Welcome to Clark Clinic, the regional paediatric cardiology ward in
        Northern Ireland. Our visiting times here are unrestricted, and we allow
        up to two adult visitors per bed space. Unfortunately, visiting children
        are not permitted on the ward unless under exceptional circumstances and
